set ball to new circle at 100, 50 size 20 moving 2, 0
set wall to new box at 200, 50 size 10, 100 fixed solid
say ball's x
say ball's size
say ball touches wall
set ball's points to 3
say ball's points
set hits to 0
when ball touches wall
  change hits by 1
  say "bump at frame {frame}"
  set ball's dx to 0
  the end
end
